Optional speech recognition uses whisper.cpp (MIT License)
  https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp
The whisper-cli engine is included in official release packages by default
(built/staged via scripts/make-whisper-bin.sh during packaging). Slim builds
may omit it with HIP_BUNDLE_WHISPER=0.

Whisper model weights are subject to the OpenAI Whisper model license /
use terms as redistributed by the Hugging Face ggerganov/whisper.cpp repo.
Models are downloaded on demand to ~/.hip/models/whisper/ and are not
shipped in the hip application package.

---

Whiteboard (knowledge board) UI embeds @excalidraw/excalidraw (MIT License)
  https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw
  npm: @excalidraw/excalidraw@0.18.1

Excalidraw fonts are self-hosted under public/excalidraw-assets/fonts
(copied from the package dist/prod/fonts via scripts/copy-excalidraw-assets.mjs)
so offline Tauri builds do not load CDN fonts. Individual typefaces are
typically under the SIL Open Font License (OFL) or similar free font licenses
as redistributed by the Excalidraw project (e.g. Virgil, Excalifont, Cascadia,
Assistant, Nunito, Lilita, Comic Shanns, Liberation, Xiaolai). See
public/excalidraw-assets/FONTS-LICENSE.txt.
